# Keep Docker build contexts lean and CORRECT: never ship host (Windows) node_modules or build
# artifacts into a Linux image — pnpm reinstalls fresh inside the builder stage. Also keeps the
# multi-GB pcb-viewer + generated PCB outputs out of the context.
**/node_modules
.git
**/dist
# TypeScript incremental cache lives at package ROOT (packages/*/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo), NOT in dist/,
# so `**/dist` alone does NOT catch it. A host (Windows) .tsbuildinfo copied into a fresh image makes
# the composite `tsc` believe dist is already emitted and SKIP it → eda-core ships no index.js/.d.ts →
# pcb-core fails with TS2307 + an implicit-any cascade. Never let stale incremental state into the build.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.layout-check
**/*.glb
apps/pcb-viewer
**/*.log
scratchpad
